摘要中的主要功能必须被所选片段支持。优先把改变用途含义的条件写进摘要，不能只藏在limitations。遇到“阶段1骨架”“cloud provider待实现”“匿名thread后续实现”等，摘要明确当前仅本地草稿/审批落盘，不说已实现匿名网络或云端发布。Codex/模型登录适配归coding-development；Oopz等语音房的对话连接归communication-integrations。自述兼容或性能用“作者称/README注明”，不冒充本次验证。
格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"Playable world-model toolkit for DeepSeek Harness: look at frames, name the 3D / pixel / latent route, measure a run, and RSI the research loop.","id":"gh:1336540316","install_available":true,"language":"JavaScript","name":"dsh-wm","slug":"WayneJin0918/dsh-wm","topics":["deepseek-harness","dsh","dsh-plugin","rsi","video-generation","world-model","world-models"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"Playable world-model toolkit for DeepSeek Harness: look at frames, name the 3D / pixel / latent rout"},{"id":"p1s2","text":"e, measure a run, and RSI the research loop."},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# DSH-WM"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"**A playable world-model toolkit for DeepSeek Harness — look at a strip, name the route, score the r"},{"id":"p3s2","text":"un, and iterate the research loop.**"},{"id":"p4s1","text":"Point the agent at a rollout (or just `fixtures/sunset`) and ask: did the second half melt, is Sora "},{"id":"p4s2","text":"even a world simulator, and which memory recipe is allowed to win."},{"id":"p5s1","text":"🚀 One command to install | Play sunset with no GPU | Built-in WM map | RSI on skills and evals"},{"id":"p6s1","text":"🌐 **English** | 中文"},{"id":"p7s1","text":"World-model work inside DeepSeek Harness is more fun when the agent can *see* the strip, *name* the "},{"id":"p7s2","text":"lineage, and *measure* the claim. DSH-WM is the profile bundle for that: contact-sheet inspect, a co"},{"id":"p7s3","text":"mpare page (side-by-side / swipe / diff heat + action HUD), three-route knowledge (3D display / pixe"},{"id":"p7s4","text":"l video-gen / latent prediction), run scoring, and an RSI loop on skills and `wm.yaml`."},{"id":"p8s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"Then try: *Triage `fixtures/sunset`. Look at first, mid, last. Is this late-horizon?*"},{"id":"p10s1","text":"DeepSeek’s product mainline can skip world models. Harness is still the research OS — this plugin is"},{"id":"p10s2","text":" the WM lab on top of it."},{"id":"p11s1","text":"**Runtime:** deepseek-ai/deepseek-harness"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"Table of contents"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"- Play it in 30 seconds\n- Highlights\n- Three routes\n- Who it is for\n- Quick start: three steps\n- Com"},{"id":"p13s2","text":"mon workflows\n- Toolbox\n- RSI with Harness\n- Acknowledgements"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"## Play it in 30 seconds"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"`fixtures/sunset` is an 8-frame toy strip. Early pred frames stay warm and close to GT; the second h"},{"id":"p15s2","text":"alf is wiped to cool blue so late-horizon collapse is obvious. No checkpoint, cluster, or GPU."},{"id":"p16s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"`wm_inspect` prints a luma sketch you can read in a terminal:"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"`wm_rollout_diff` on the same strip reports a second-half SSIM drop and names frames 4–6 as the wors"},{"id":"p19s2","text":"t window. `wm_view` writes a local compare page if you want to scrub pred vs GT. Look, score, then o"},{"id":"p19s3","text":"wm_view` writes a local compare page if you want to scrub pred vs GT. Look, score, then open a card."},{"id":"p20s1","text":"## Highlights"},{"id":"p21s1","text":"- **Install and play.** Official DSH bundle, pure JavaScript, no `prepare` / `allowBuilds`. Sunset w"},{"id":"p21s2","text":"orks from `node cli.js` before you even open Harness.\n- **Look at the frames in-repo.** `wm_inspect`"},{"id":"p21s3","text":" samples first / mid / last (or named indices), writes a contact sheet, and returns a luma sketch pl"},{"id":"p21s4","text":"us a color/contrast look.\n- **Compare the page yourself.** `wm_view` writes a self-contained HTML pa"},{"id":"p21s5","text":"ge: side-by-side, swipe overlay, abs-diff heatmap, SSIM timeline, and an action HUD when `actions.js"},{"id":"p21s6","text":"on` is present.\n- **Name the route first.** 3D display, pixel / video-gen WM, and latent prediction "},{"id":"p21s7","text":"are three exams. `wm-routes` then `display-3d` / `pixel-wm` / `latent-wm`.\n- **A run is a directory."},{"id":"p21s8","text":"** Optional `wm.yaml` declares pred / gt / log / metrics / actions. No manifest → heuristics. Cannot"},{"id":"p21s9","text":" tell → candidates and warnings, never invented paths.\n- **Measure when you have a run.** `wm_discov"},{"id":"p21s10","text":"er` → `wm_summarize` → `wm_rollout_diff` → `wm_inspect` → `wm_view` for layout, logs, numbers, a loo"},{"id":"p21s11","text":"k, and a page you can scrub.\n- **Built-in WM knowledge.** Technique cards for chunk-AR, memory, KV, "},{"id":"p21s12","text":"exposure bias, revisit, ablation, action following, cache eviction, and RSI-in-Harness. `wm_knowledg"},{"id":"p21s13","text":"e` / `wm_diagnose` before a new architecture.\n- **RSI on the harness layer.** Skill `wm-rsi` uses DS"},{"id":"p21s14","text":"H trajectory, fork, Creator, and sunset to evolve skills, `wm.yaml`, and eval notes.\n- **Skills that"},{"id":"p21s15","text":" keep the game honest.** Triage, knowledge, RSI, fair ablation, revisit.\n- **No GPU required to star"},{"id":"p21s16","text":"t.** Rollout scores are luminance SSIM + MSE in pure JS. Videos need `ffmpeg`; PNG/PPM folders do no"},{"id":"p21s17","text":"** Rollout scores are luminance SSIM + MSE in pure JS. Videos need `ffmpeg`; PNG/PPM folders do not."},{"id":"p22s1","text":"## Three routes"},{"id":"p23s1","text":"The word “world model” is three research games. Cards follow the map in Awesome World Models. Open `"},{"id":"p23s2","text":"wm-routes` before you design a backbone."},{"id":"p24s1","text":"| Route | Card | What it predicts | What “good” looks like | Field tropes |"},{"id":"p25s1","text":"| **3D display** | `display-3d` | Geometry you can fly / occupy (mesh, Gaussian, occupancy, 4D) | Sp"},{"id":"p25s2","text":"atial consistency, explorable scene | Consistency is bought, not painted; a fly-through is a display"},{"id":"p25s3","text":" until the stick does something |\n| **Pixel / video-gen WM** | `pixel-wm` | The next pixels, often a"},{"id":"p25s4","text":"ction-conditioned | An interactive strip that still obeys the stick | “Is Sora a world simulator?”; "},{"id":"p25s5","text":"pretty clip, wrong joystick; Self-Forcing / late melt |\n| **Latent prediction** | `latent-wm` | The "},{"id":"p25s6","text":"next compact state (RSSM, JEPA, DINO) | Planning / control in the dream | Do not pay the loss on eve"},{"id":"p25s7","text":"ry pixel; a decoded video is a projector |"},{"id":"p26s1","text":"A forgotten room is `revisit-eval` on a pixel strip, a pose / occupancy check on a 3D scene, and a l"},{"id":"p26s2","text":"atent-state mismatch on JEPA / Dreamer. Name the route, then measure."},{"id":"p27s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p28s1","text":"## Who it is for"},{"id":"p29s1","text":"| You want to… | DSH-WM gives you |"},{"id":"p30s1","text":"| **Play a rollout without a cluster** | Sunset + `wm_inspect` / `wm_rollout_diff` on a laptop |\n| *"},{"id":"p30s2","text":"*See what a run directory actually contains** | `wm_discover` — layout, paths, frame counts, warning"},{"id":"p30s3","text":"s |\n| **Turn a log tail into a next test** | `wm_summarize` — last loss / NaN / early-stop plus thre"},{"id":"p30s4","text":"e hypotheses |\n| **Put a number on “looks worse”** | `wm_rollout_diff` — mean/min SSIM, curve, worst"},{"id":"p30s5","text":" frames, diagnosis |\n| **Look at those worst frames** | `wm_inspect` — contact sheet, luma sketches,"},{"id":"p30s6","text":" per-tile look |\n| **Scrub pred vs GT and the stick** | `wm_view` — side-by-side / swipe / heat, act"},{"id":"p30s7","text":"ion arrow, followed / dropped |\n| **Place a paper on the map** | `wm-routes` → `display-3d` / `pixel"},{"id":"p30s8","text":"-wm` / `latent-wm` |\n[该节后续省略]"},{"id":"p31s1","text":"## How it works"},{"id":"p32s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p33s1","text":"Three layers, one session:"},{"id":"p34s1","text":"1. **Knowledge** — name the route, then open a technique card.\n2. **Measure** — filesystem tools plu"},{"id":"p34s2","text":"s `wm_inspect` and `wm_view`.\n3. **RSI** — evolve the research loop and pass the sunset gate."},{"id":"p35s1","text":"### Requirements"},{"id":"p36s1","text":"- DeepSeek Harness `0.1.0-rc.6` or compatible, with `pnpm` on PATH for `dsh plugin`.\n- Node.js 18+.\n"},{"id":"p36s2","text":"- Optional `ffmpeg` for JPEG or video inputs. PNG/PPM frame directories work offline."}],"truncated":true}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
